{"parse": {"title": "习题课", "pageid": 97373, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; border: solid 1px #ec5d00; display: inline-block; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 1px; background-color: #00000050;\"><b>活动时间：</b>常驻</div>\n<p><b>习题课<span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（After-class Exercise）</span></b>在通过新手引导后于活动页面内开启，完成教学课题交代的挑战，可获得律的调校【伟大乐队】、<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/133023\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F\" title=\"十四行诗的造像\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F\" title=\"十四行诗的造像\"><img alt=\"十四行诗的造像\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Item-133023.png/100px-Item-133023.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Item-133023.png/150px-Item-133023.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Item-133023.png/200px-Item-133023.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F\" title=\"十四行诗的造像\">十四行诗的造像</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">黑色底片上一张张熟悉或陌生的脸，可用于角色塑造。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span> 以及<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/2\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"纯雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/100px-CurrencyItem-202.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/150px-CurrencyItem-202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/200px-CurrencyItem-202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\">纯雨滴</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学界昂贵无比的货币。可用于征集与恢复细胞活性。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×460</span></span> 的奖励。\n</p>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E5.88.B6.E6.95.8C.E5.BE.8B.E5.88.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"制敌律则\">制敌律则</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>01</b></span> 灵感克制 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-01\" title=\"TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Afflatus Superiority</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji kezhi.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_kezhi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>万物的灵感犹如生态的循环。在灵感克制条件下，神秘术产生的影响将更为深远，造成的伤害更大。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《灵感论》第一章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分战斗中，双方的灵感会存在克制关系。因此需要遵循灵感的规则，针对合适的目标使用神秘术。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——克制关系？像两块磁铁一样吗？</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>02</b></span> 集攻策略 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-02\" title=\"TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Concentrated Attack Strategy</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji jihuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jihuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>敌方的行动与其同伴数量密切相关。敌方减员的同时，其行动能力也将受到打击。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——教员口述的经验</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当敌人数量众多，他们的行动也将更加肆无忌惮。要洞察出威胁最大的敌人，并优先集火解决它。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——敌人也许同样会对我或者其他同伴这样做……</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>03</b></span> 多元伤害 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-03\" title=\"TH-03\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Diversified Damage</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji leixing.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_leixing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>思想与物质相互交织，神秘术所造成的伤害将分为两种类型：现实伤害、精神伤害。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术导论》第二章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有些敌人异常敏锐，他们会闪避特定类型的伤害。谨记时刻调查咒语的类型，使用合适的咒语。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——精神与现实……这说明我们总会在某一方面出现弱点吗？</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.92.92.E8.AF.AD.E9.98.B6.E6.AC.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"咒语阶次\">咒语阶次</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>04</b></span> 初试升阶 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-04\" title=\"TH-04\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Fundamental Upgrade</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji hecheng.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>凝聚神秘术的力量，能将咒语融合升阶。这将能深化咒语的影响，也能改变神秘术的效果。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术导论》序章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当普通咒语对敌人的影响微乎其微时，需要进一步融合咒语，使其能发挥出更强的影响。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——我似乎很少碰见这种程度的敌人……</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>05</b></span> 高效升阶 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-05\" title=\"TH-05\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Advanced Upgrade</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji hecheng 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>咒语融合有其技巧，其中最重要的技巧就是“被动融合”，“被动融合”能让行动事半功倍。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术导论》序章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被动融合可以节省行动次数。战斗里将出现不少被动融合咒语的机会。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——像是一条捷径……不过，捷径不一定总是好事。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>06</b></span> 阶次法则 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-06\" title=\"TH-06\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Merging Rule</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji hecheng 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_hecheng_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>为了凝聚力量，有时需消耗行动次数，以移动咒语，从而促成咒语融合升阶。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术导论》第一章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行动次数弥足珍贵，主动移动咒语会消耗行动次数，因此需要谨慎对待咒语的移动。\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8E.A7.E5.88.B6.E8.89.BA.E6.9C.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"控制艺术\">控制艺术</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>07</b></span> 缴械技艺 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-07\" title=\"TH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Tactic to Disarm</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji jiaoxie.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiaoxie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>缴械咒语能够无效化对象的攻击神秘术。这是控制型神秘术中，最为基础的咒语。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术原理》第一章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>若敌人的攻势迅猛，使用缴械咒语能有效阻止他们的进攻。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——这节课程中，教员的要求很苛刻，我好像是少数达标的学生。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>08</b></span> 缄默技艺 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-08\" title=\"TH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Tactic to Silence</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji jianmo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jianmo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>缄默咒语能够屏蔽对象的辅助神秘术，无效化其辅助影响。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术原理》第二章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制伏擅长使用辅助神秘术的敌人，缄默咒语是最合适的神秘术。它能有效减少敌人的干扰，并防止他们彼此援助。\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>09</b></span> 调停技艺 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-09\" title=\"TH-09\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Tactic to Mediate</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji fengyin.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_fengyin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>任何神秘学家都拥有“至终的仪式”，如果要破坏仪式的施行，可以向对象使用封印与削减激情的神秘术。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术原理》第三章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有些敌人情绪高昂，且每回合都会使用“至终的仪式”。这时候需要对其使用封印或削减激情的咒语来打断仪式。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——……他们会像讲话被打断的教员一样生气吗？</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.8C.E5.8A.A8.E4.B8.BB.E4.B9.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"行动主义\">行动主义</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>10</b></span> 仪式蕴蓄 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-10\" title=\"TH-10\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Prepare for the Ultimate</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji jiqing.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>“至终的仪式”是激情充盈时，方可施行的强大神秘术。它根据神秘学家的本质而变化。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《神秘术导论》第十章</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战斗中，有时会面临其他神秘术收效甚微，仅有“至终的仪式”能发挥作用的情况。届时，需要积极行动，通过咒语的融合、移动、使用，迅速蕴蓄仪式。\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>11</b></span> 藏锋蓄锐 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-11\" title=\"TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Buy Time</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji cunliangzhunze.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_cunliangzhunze.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>及时整备队伍是取胜的关键之一。抓紧时机进行治疗与休整，以便用最佳状态应对战斗。记住，求胜不急于一时。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《策略概论》摘选</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尽快击败敌人以争取休整机会，在强敌到来前尽可能地恢复实力。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——是的，轻视敌人会令我们失败。保持谦逊，保持尊重。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>12</b></span> 游移校验 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-12\" title=\"TH-12\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Start with Ultimate</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji jiqing 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_jiqing_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>蕴蓄仪式的方式<br />一、使用咒语<br />二、移动咒语<small style=\"color: #999;\">（《神秘术导论》测验重点）</small><br />……\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敌人会在第二回合展开猛烈的攻势。届时若未蕴蓄好“至终的仪式”，我方将会被轻易击溃。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——教员在导论课程结束后，给出了这个测验重点……玛蒂尔达似乎忘记记下来了。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BE.8B.E7.9A.84.E8.B0.83.E6.A0.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"律的调校\">律的调校</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>13</b></span> 律动·其一 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-13\" title=\"TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Rhythm O' One</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji zhujuejineng.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>“律的调校”是一种独一无二的能力，来源于特定的灵感，其可打破事物的规律，拥有重组、变化事物以及……<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——未知的书籍</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当普通的神秘术无法改变局面，便唯有通过“律的调校”打破事物规律，以此扭转危险的局面。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——难以置信，我还没有见过有人使用这种能力……</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>14</b></span> 律动·其二 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-14\" title=\"TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Rhythm O' Two</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji zhujuejineng 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_zhujuejineng_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>正如上文所述，“律的调校”能使事物重组、变化，带来逆转局势的机会。在合适的时机……<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——未知的书籍</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时更改已凝结的咒语，这样做有很大风险。但危急时刻，唯有孤注一掷。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——拼尽全力求生，才有机会……我想，这比直接放弃好。决不能放弃。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.AD.96.E7.95.A5.E6.8E.A8.E6.BC.94\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"策略推演\">策略推演</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>15</b></span> 协同作战 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-15\" title=\"TH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Co-op Attack</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji qungong.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_qungong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>面对数量较多的敌人，有效的应敌策略将减轻战斗压力。在你的同伴瞄准多个目标时，谨慎考虑如何使用咒语达成配合。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《策略概论》摘选</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在范围影响的咒语，将会随机影响第二位敌人。优先消灭其他敌人，以保证咒语对固定目标生效。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——在战斗中要不断思考，判断咒语生效的范围和对象。这应该是重要的技巧……</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>16</b></span> 循序巧攻 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-16\" title=\"TH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Skillful Attack</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji shunxu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_shunxu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>咒语的使用顺序，将影响神秘术力量的展现。观察局势，制定最佳方案。这是每位神秘学家要学习的基础策略。<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《策略概论》摘选</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谨记确认持有的神秘术，部分咒语满足条件后，将发挥特殊效果。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——当时我有些分心，并没有把内容完整地记下来……维尔汀会把这个记下来吗？</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.90.8E.E9.AA.8C.E4.B9.8B.E8.B7.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"后验之路\">后验之路</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable responsive\" style=\"max-width: 90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 15%\">章节</th>\n<th>图片</th>\n<th>描述\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>17</b></span> 课程检定 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-17\" title=\"TH-17\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Targeting Exam</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji tiaozhan1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_tiaozhan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>\"现在是检验你们学习成果的时刻。牢记神秘术的克制关系！评定级数未达要求的同学，将会被缩短休息时间，用以重修课程。\"<br />          <small style=\"color: #999;\">——教员的考前嘱托</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有时，敌人被击败后会治疗剩余的同伴。先针对其中一位，尽快使其减员，再使用范围较大的神秘术，将剩下的敌人同时击败。<br /><i><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>——测验下周就开始了，再复习一遍……昨天有同学找我借笔记，待会要记得拿给她。</b></span></i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>18</b></span> 伺机而发 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-18\" title=\"TH-18\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Play A Waiting Game</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji sp xulie.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_xulie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>谨记不同神秘术的效果与使用情境。<br />——《神秘术原理》重点\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有些敌人的攻击会存在某种规律。洞察出这种规律，将会是赢下战斗的一个重要契机。<br />在未确定敌人情况前，可以先采用削弱敌人的策略。\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>19</b></span> 深见远虑 <a href=\"/wiki/TH-19\" title=\"TH-19\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a> <br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Visionary Insights</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bg jiaoxuebiji sp qianzhi.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png/100px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png/150px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png/200px-Bg_jiaoxuebiji_sp_qianzhi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"448\" data-file-height=\"312\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>掌握本书的知识后，并不意味你已成为合格的神秘学家。学会在实践中运用这些策略，你才……<br /><small style=\"color: #999;\">——《策略概论》摘选</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>若敌人的力量强于己方，就需要先用神秘术增益自身，再行进攻。运用牵制敌人的策略，为蕴蓄激情争取时间。\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "游戏活动"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">习题课 <small><span style=\"color:grey\">After-class Exercise</span></small></span></span>"}}